      "code": "if((value + ps_slice_hdr->i1_num_long_term_sps + num_neg_pics + num_pos_pics) > (MAX_DPB_SIZE - 1))",
      "role": "root_cause",
      "note": "The bounds check is done in 32-bit arithmetic, so a very large parsed value can wrap the sum and pass the MAX_DPB_SIZE check."
    },
    {
      "step": 3,
      "file": "libhevc/decoder/ihevcd_parse_slice_header.c",
      "function": "ihevcd_parse_slice_header",
